sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as User (patient/doctor)
  participant FE as App / Portal
  participant KC as Keycloak (+ OTP authenticator)
  participant NOTI as Notification svc
  participant CH as WhatsApp / SMS / Email (Resend)
  U->>FE: Enter phone / email
  FE->>KC: Begin OIDC auth (PKCE)
  KC->>KC: Rate-limit + anti-enumeration + risk check
  KC->>NOTI: Request OTP delivery
  NOTI->>CH: Send code (DLT/WA-template/Resend)
  CH-->>U: One-time code
  U->>FE: Enter code
  FE->>KC: Verify
  KC-->>FE: JWT (tenant_id, branch_id, roles) + refresh
  Note over FE,KC: Staff/admin use password+TOTP or passkeys, not OTP-only
